<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<div class="container my-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
  <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
      <div class="icon-circle bg-danger-subtle text-danger me-3 p-3 rounded-circle fs-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Last updated: August 2026 • Wanderlust Security & Privacy Team</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <hr class="my-4">
    
    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-3 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We collect personal information that you provide to us when registering for an account, hosting a stay, or communicating with us. This includes your name, email address, phone number, payment information, and listing location details.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-3 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Your information is used to facilitate bookings, personalize your travel search experience, verify host listings, improve platform security, and ensure seamless communication between guests and hosts.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-3 mb-2">3. Data Security & Protection</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We employ industry-standard encryption, secure socket layer (SSL) protocols, and MongoDB security best practices to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-3 mb-2">4. Contact Us</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-0">
      If you have any questions or concerns regarding our privacy practices, please contact our Privacy Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@wanderlust.com" class="text-danger fw-semibold">privacy@wanderlust.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
